    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Your website sends a message\nWhen someone types something into your portfolio chatbot, the message is sent to this workflow.\n\nThe workflow receives that message\nThe first node (the webhook) catches the message and starts the workflow.\n\nIt then fetches your portfolio information\nThe workflow calls your API to get your skills, experience, projects, and other details.\n\nThis information gets cleaned and organized\nAnother node formats your portfolio data so it is easy for the AI to understand.\n\nThe workflow remembers the conversation\nA memory node keeps track of what the user said earlier so the AI can respond naturally.\n\nThe AI receives everything it needs\n\nThe user’s message\n\nYour portfolio data\n\nThe conversation history\n\nYour instructions (how the AI should talk)\n\nThen it generates a helpful response.\n\nThe response is cleaned up\nThe workflow extracts only the AI’s final answer.\n\nThe answer is sent back to your website\nThe final node delivers the chatbot’s response so the user sees it instantly.",
        "height": 656,
        "width": 736
      },
